{"id":"665731","name":"木耳炒山药","author":"polaris滴食记","authorId":"10301589","desc":"","cover":"images/665731/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"山药","amount":"100克"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"100克"},{"name":"干木耳","amount":"10克"}],"sub":[{"name":"稻米油","amount":"15毫升"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"炒锅内倒入15毫升稻米油。","img":"images/665731/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"先将100克胡萝卜片放入煸炒至断生。","img":"images/665731/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入汆烫泡发好的黑木耳，煸炒均匀。","img":"images/665731/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入适量的清水。","img":"images/665731/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"盖上锅盖炖煮5分钟。","img":"images/665731/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入100克山药片继续炖煮2分钟。","img":"images/665731/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"淋上一勺生抽。","img":"images/665731/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"翻炒均匀即可出锅。","img":"images/665731/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/665731/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}